"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"khevrah"},{"he":"שוק","en":"market","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"shuk"},{"he":"רווח","en":"profit","alt":["gain"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"revakh"},{"he":"משקיעים","en":"investors","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"mashki'im"},{"he":"רווחים","en":"profits","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"revakhim"},{"he":"סוחרים","en":"traders","alt":["trade (v.)"],"from":"skill","tr":"sokhrim"},{"he":"מייבאים","en":"import (v.)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"meyav'im"},{"he":"מייצאים","en":"export (v.)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"meyatz'im"},{"he":"מייצאת","en":"exports (f.)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"meyatze't"},{"he":"כלכלה","en":"economy","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"kalkalah"},{"he":"תוכנה","en":"software","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"tokhnah"},{"he":"נפט","en":"oil","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"neft"},{"he":"מוצרים","en":"products","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"mutzarim"},{"he":"המניות","en":"the stocks","alt":["the shares"],"from":"phrase","tr":"hamaniyot"},{"he":"היזם","en":"the entrepreneur","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"hayazam"},{"he":"הרווח","en":"the profit","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"harevakh"}],"lexemes":["מניה","מניות","המניות","המניה","בורסה","הבורסה","יבוא","היבוא","יצוא","היצוא","סחר","הסחר","יזם","היזם","היזמים","חברה","החברה","שוק","השוק","רווח","הרווח","רווחים","הרווחים","משקיעים","סוחרים","מייבאים","מייצאים","מייצאת","כלכלה","תוכנה","נפט","מוצרים","גייס","הקים"],"tips":"## Business and Commerce Vocabulary\n\n### Key Financial Terms\n| Hebrew | English | Root |\n|--------|---------|------|\n| **מניה** (pl. מניות) | stock, share | |\n| **בורסה** | stock exchange | from German |\n| **רווח** (pl. רווחים) | profit, gain | ר.ו.ח |\n| **שוק** (pl. שווקים) | market | |\n\n### Import / Export\n| Hebrew | English | Root |\n|--------|---------|------|\n| **יבוא** | import | י.ב.א (to come in) |\n| **יצוא** | export | י.צ.א (to go out) |\n| **סחר** | trade, commerce | ס.ח.ר |\n\nNotice the logic: **יבוא** (import) comes from the root \"to come in\" and **יצוא** (export) from \"to go out.\"\n\n### Business People\n| Hebrew | English |\n|--------|---------|\n| **יזם** | entrepreneur |\n| **משקיע** (pl. משקיעים) | investor |\n| **סוחר** (pl. סוחרים) | trader, merchant |\n\n### Useful Phrases\n- **הבורסה עלתה / ירדה** -- The market went up / down\n- **הרווח הנקי** -- Net profit\n- **סחר חופשי** -- Free trade\n- **סחר בינלאומי** -- International trade\n- **הקים חברה** -- Founded a company\n- **גייס כסף** -- Raised money / capital"}
